CORE
main.cpp

^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ sum of I: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ sizeof B: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ sizeof I: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] line \d+ one B: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] line \d+ trailing return type: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.6\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
Class template instantiation expanded folds over the template's last
parameter pack only.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18 accept this program, and it
fails only its WRONG assertion.
